ndition holds too.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_slater_strict_complementarity_kernel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_slater_strict_complementarity_kernel","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L205-L224","doc":"**`slater_strict_complementarity_kernel_axiom` is FALSE** — the\ncomplementarity-difference hypotheses hold vacuously when `S = 0`.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_unique","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L192-L203","doc":"**`strict_complementarity_unique_axiom` is FALSE.**\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDP.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_rank_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_rank_eq","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L178-L183","doc":"The rank guard `rank Φ⋆ + rank S = n` is **satisfied** here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d10","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L172-L176","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d01","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L166-L170","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc2","kind":"def","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L150-L164","doc":"`Φ⋆ = diag(0,1)`: PSD, feasible, and objective-matching, since\n`tr(diag(1,0) * diag(0,1)) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_dualSlack","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_dualSlack","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L146-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP","kind":"def","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L140-L144","doc":"Two dimensions, no constraints, `cost = diag(1,0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.one_ne_zero_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.one_ne_zero_matrix","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L131-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L116-L129","doc":"The ℝ-layer strict-complementarity pair at `Φ⋆ = 0`.  Unlike\n`scPair` this one discharges *genuine* `dualSlack_psd` and\n`obj_eq_dualObj` fields — the extra structure does not help,\nbecause the dual slack is zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.scPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.scPair","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L103-L114","doc":"The generic-ring strict-complementarity pair at `Φ⋆ = 0`.  Both\n`dual_feas` and `obj_eq` are `True` placeholders in\n`StrongDualityPair`, so they discharge with `trivial`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_zero","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L100-L101","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_one","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L97-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_strictlyFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_strictlyFeasible","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L94-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_dualSlack","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_dualSlack","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L91-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L84-L89","doc":"One dimension, no constraints, **zero** cost: every PSD matrix is\noptimal and the dual slack is the zero matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_zero","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L76-L80","doc":"The zero matrix is PSD over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_diag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_diag","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L65-L74","doc":"A real diagonal matrix with non-negative entries is PSD. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.posdef_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.posdef_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L54-L63","doc":"The identity matrix is positive-definite over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}